  <compounddef id="Temporarily-example" kind="example">
    <compoundname>Temporarily</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Enable or disable arena resizing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enable or disable arena resizing<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>toggle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>If true, enable resizing; if false, disable resizing</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Dynamically enables or disables the arena&apos;s ability to grow by allocating additional chunks. Only works for DYNAMIC arenas that own their memory. Has no effect on STATIC or SUB arenas (they cannot resize regardless).</para>
<para>Useful for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Enforcing strict memory limits during critical sections</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Testing allocation failure handling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Preventing unbounded growth</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>disable growth <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>arena<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacecslt_1ad55f4168d9f1832627c6d75e60d14a6c" kindref="member">cslt::move</ref>(<ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArenaAllocator_1ab71e5fc5e1cf3e9b07ad7208465a7b0f" kindref="member">cslt::ArenaAllocator::Heap</ref>(4096,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">).value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Fill<sp/>initial<sp/>capacity</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(arena-&gt;remaining()<sp/>&gt;=<sp/>64)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(64);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Can<sp/>still<sp/>grow</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ptr1<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">assert(ptr1.hasValue());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Disable<sp/>growth</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">arena-&gt;toggle_resize(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">false</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Fill<sp/>again</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(arena-&gt;remaining()<sp/>&gt;=<sp/>64)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(64);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>This<sp/>will<sp/>fail<sp/>-<sp/>no<sp/>growth<sp/>allowed</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ptr2<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">assert(!ptr2.hasValue());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Re-enable<sp/>growth</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">arena-&gt;toggle_resize(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Now<sp/>works<sp/>again</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ptr3<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(1024);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">assert(ptr3.hasValue());</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <programlisting filename="Temporarily"></programlisting> </para>
